# Prettier checks the JavaScript, the JSON and the configuration files. It also skips what
# .gitignore names.

# Third-party bundles and generated files.
static/vendor/
package-lock.json
# Written by the coverage ratchet of paxel/gates.
.github/badges/

# The style sheets: app.css is built by Tailwind, and app.input.css is its source, whose
# layout the Tailwind directives rely on.
*.css

# Markdown, YAML and AsciiDoc keep the layout they are written in: the tables with aligned
# pipes and the aligned comments, which prettier would rewrite.
*.md
*.yml
*.yaml
*.adoc

# The pages in static/ and the Askama templates in templates/: prettier does not know the
# template syntax, and reformatting the pages would change every line of them.
*.html
